   2. `VideoStateController.java` — simplified `restoreVideoFormat()`
   3. `VideoMenuPresenter.java` — merged signed/unsigned dialog methods into `prepareAndShowDialog(boolean)`
   4. `SuggestionsController.java` — extracted `updateChapterFocus(boolean)` helper

   Immediately before the summary request, the assistant had read `PlayerUIController.java` lines 424–474 showing `onDislikeClicked` and `onLikeClicked`:
